  "notes": "{破|やぶ}る is a transitive godan verb with three related meanings: tear, break/violate, and defeat.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {破|やぶ}る ({他動詞|たどうし}): to tear/break/defeat\n- {破|やぶ}れる ({自動詞|じどうし}): to be torn; to lose (a match)\n\nSENSE 1 - TEAR:\n- {紙|かみ}を{破|やぶ}る: tear paper\n- {封筒|ふうとう}を{破|やぶ}る: tear open an envelope\n\nSENSE 2 - BREAK/VIOLATE:\n- {約束|やくそく}を{破|やぶ}る: break a promise\n- {記録|きろく}を{破|やぶ}る: break a record\n- {沈黙|ちんもく}を{破|やぶ}る: break the silence\n- {法律|ほうりつ}を{破|やぶ}る: break the law\n\nSENSE 3 - DEFEAT:\n- {相手|あいて}を{破|やぶ}る: defeat an opponent\n- 3{対|たい}1で{破|やぶ}る: defeat 3 to 1",
